"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<b>Player</b>: hi <br/>\nFernlor: I am the High Scryer of the Arcane Academy. I need your help on a mission to investigate an anomaly that I discovered. <br/>\n<b>Player</b>: <b>mission</b> <br/>\nFernlor: As far as the people here are concerned you are some kind of hero. And even better, you often work for free! Which, I must say, really helps, given the limited resources allocated to my operation. ... <br/>\nFernlor: I need someone with your skill set to find out what's going on there. Are you up to it? Yes or no? <br/>\n<b>Player</b>: <b>Yes</b> <br/>\nFernlor: Excellent! My first probes suggest you probably won't die by environmental hazards on arrival. ... <br/>\nFernlor: To summarize things: I found a recent disturbance at some remote, uncharted isle in the east. I established a teleport connection to that place. ... <br/>\nFernlor: I am a researcher, not an explorer though so it needs someone with your unique and proven talent to find out what's going on there. Take the teleporter over there! <br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fernlor</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["fiend-slayer-outfits-quest","no-rest-for-the-wicked-quest"],"pos":{"x":33281,"y":3184